                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fba6f82d-c392-3f83-bf11-e27c0f4fa45e",
                        "entry_id": "d6176d9f-8fc5-38fd-8b18-107ee8a3878d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Vedic poet and seer who composed Rigvedic hymns, who alone or with others invokes the deities with poetry of a sacred character."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4c7f856-514d-4c34-9133-914178c9fbd2",
                                "sense_id": "fba6f82d-c392-3f83-bf11-e27c0f4fa45e",
                                "text": "The rishi asked one unfathomable question after another, until both he and his audience were reduced to the silence of unknowing."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5469e8dc-291b-387e-bfc4-18db2aafc8d8",
                        "entry_id": "d6176d9f-8fc5-38fd-8b18-107ee8a3878d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Hindu sage or saint occupying the same position in India's history as the patriarchs of other countries, constituting a peculiar class of beings in the early mythical system, as distinct from Asuras, Devas and mortal men."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aa701a86-9fee-4159-8b6e-d157718b03fa",
                                "sense_id": "5469e8dc-291b-387e-bfc4-18db2aafc8d8",
                                "text": "In the beginning Max had no idea she was even a film actress, this girl with the skin the colour of scorched earth, the well-concealed body and the demure manner of a disciple walking in the footsteps of a great rishi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
